  "contentHtml": "<div>\r\n<div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금성출판사 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학년 교과서에 우리은하 모형 만들기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(323</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쪽</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가 나옵니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리은하 사진 위에 투명 종이로 본을 뜨고 두꺼운 종이에 붙인 다음</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리 은하 라인을 따라 색 모래를 뿌려 모형을 완성하는 방법입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예술 감각이 유난히 뛰어난 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학년 아이들이 색 모래가 자유자재로 다루어지지 않자 속상해 하였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리은하의 모양과 태양계의 위치를 이해하는 방법으로 괜찮은 아이디어라고 생각합니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">색 모래 때문에 종일 반짝대는 하루였습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실험대위가 반짝</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">옷이 반짝</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">손도 반짝</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">입술도 반짝</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">~ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수업 후 그토록 꼼꼼하게 청소하였건만</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">… </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">창체 동아리 시간에 팝콘 만들기를 하는데 여기저기 반짝거려 긴장하였네요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">혹시 반짝이 팝콘이 만들어질까 봐요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. ^^</span></p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아이들이 결과물을 두고 성에 차지 않는다고 하였지만 만드는 과정을 지켜본 저는 이만하면 잘 했다고 칭찬하고 싶습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(2</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">인 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">조로 만들었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">마지막 사진은 접시위에 색 모래를 섞는 장면입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2754E4435823F7690A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"567\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"우리은하1.jpg\"  id=\"A_2754E4435823F7690A43E3\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2169183E5823F77732\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"567\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"우리은하3.jpg\"  id=\"A_2169183E5823F777320D1D\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/225957435823F78006\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"567\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"우리은하4.jpg\"  id=\"A_225957435823F78006D8DC\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2529F73E5823F78D07\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"567\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"우리은하2.jpg\"  id=\"A_2529F73E5823F78D0734E8\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p></div>\r\n<p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
